@Feature6394
Feature: Capping 6394 Calculate capping payments on reciept of actual

@IntegrationTest
Scenario: Test Capping of EOP for different scenarios applied to the different Deliverables

#Scenario 1 (Del 24): A contract containing an EOP contract allocation is approved on time. It has two capping periods and the current period is within the first capping period. Actuals are submitted during the first capping period and a cap is breached in the first capping period (but would not breach if using allocation duration capping)
#Scenario 2 (Del 3): A contract containing an EOP contract allocation is approved on time. It has two capping periods and the current period is within the first capping period and no cap is breached in the first capping period on receipt of actuals
#Scenario 9: A contract containing an EOP contract allocation is approved on time but the allocation is shorter than the FSP
#Extra (Del 4): Actuals returned for deliverable with no planned value (so will be capped)
#Extra (Del 6): Actuals returned for deliverable with no planned value in AY1 but planned value in AY2 (exceeding AY1 actuals) (so will be capped)
#Extra (Del 5): Zero actuals returned for deliverable with planned value (no recon or cap)

